    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n43243" root="لحق" body-key="l">
    
      1 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لَحِقَهُ</span></b>  and 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لَحِقَ بِهِ</span></b>  and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَلْحَقَهُ</span></b>  <i>He reached him;
overtook him;</i> or <i>came up with him.</i> (S, Msb, K.)
― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لَحِقَهُ</span> <i>It</i> (grief, &amp;c.) <i>overtook him;</i> or <i>ensued
to him.</i> ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  Also, and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لَحِقَ بِهِ</span> <i>He overtook him;
came up with him.</i> ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b4-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لَحِقَ بِهِ</span> <i>He became,</i> or
<i>made himself, on a par,</i> or <i>as though on a par,
with him.</i> See an ex. voce <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَوَحَّشَ</span>. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b5-  <i>It became
adjoined,</i> or <i>annexed, to it.</i> ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b6-  ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لُوحكَ</span></b>  <i>It was
firmly,</i> or <i>strongly, compacted</i> or <i>coherent</i> or
<i>knit together:</i> and <i>its several parts were inserted
one into another.</i> (TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b7-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لَحِقَهُ الثَّمَنُ</span>, inf. n.
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لُحُوقٌ</span>, [<i>i. q.</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَدْرَكَهُ</span>, i. e. The payment of] <i>the price
was,</i> or <i>became, obligatory on him.</i> (Msb.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b8- 
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لَحِقَتْ قُوَّتُهُ وَسِنُّهُ</span>: see the last sentence of art.
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عون</span>. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b9-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لَحِقَهُ</span> has for its inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لُحُوقٌ</span> as well
as <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لَحَاقٌ</span>. (TA.)

